<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week - Nov 18.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week - Nov 18.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the 10 largest gaining and falling stocks for Australian companies included in the Australian Stock Exchange's ASX 100 index for the week to November 15.</p>
<p>Top 10 largest gains in week</p>
<p>Rank Name			  Price     pct change</p>
<p>1  Pasminco			2.10	     9.38</p>
<p>2  Acacia Resources	    2.55	     8.97</p>
<p>3  Lihir Gold		    2.59	     7.02</p>
<p>4  Lend Lease		   22.90	     7.01</p>
